# Optional. Raises GitHub API rate limits for commit search, recap, and compare.
# Create a classic PAT with public_repo (or no scopes — public read is enough).
# Strongly recommended for the leaderboard indexer: batched GraphQL hydration
# needs a token (1 rate point per 8 users); without one the indexer falls
# back to the slower per-profile HTML calendar path.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Required for scheduled leaderboard indexing. Vercel Cron (vercel.json) calls
# /api/cron/index-board every 3 hours with `Authorization: Bearer $CRON_SECRET`;
# `npm run index:board` uses the same secret. Any long random string.
CRON_SECRET=
